# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo-root .vercelignore — universal exclusions ONLY.
#
# This file is read by EVERY Vercel project in this monorepo (mingla-admin,
# mingla-business, mingla-marketing) regardless of each project's Root
# Directory setting. List ONLY paths that NO Vercel project ever needs to
# deploy. Project-internal cruft (node_modules, .env, build artifacts, sibling
# project sources) lives in per-project .vercelignore files under the
# corresponding Root Directory:
#
#   - mingla-admin/.vercelignore     ← admin project's exclusions
#   - mingla-business/.vercelignore  ← business project's exclusions
#   - mingla-marketing/.vercelignore ← marketing project's exclusions
#
# Architecture documented in docs/runbooks/VERCEL_VERCELIGNORE_ARCHITECTURE.md.
# Established by ORCH-0857 [Vercel .vercelignore project-aware split]
# 2026-05-17 after PR #122's cacheless marketing build failed because the prior
# repo-root file listed `mingla-marketing/` as ignored (a cross-project entry
# that stripped the marketing source for the marketing project's own build).
#
# RULE: do NOT add any subfolder of `mingla-admin/`, `mingla-business/`, or
# `mingla-marketing/` to this file. Project-internal ignores belong in the
# per-project .vercelignore files. If you need to add a NEW non-Vercel folder
# at repo root (e.g., a new mobile-only or backend-only directory), add it
# here so all three projects skip uploading it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

node_modules/

# Non-Vercel codebases — mobile, backend, scripts, docs, archives.
/app-mobile/
/backend/
/oauth-redirect/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/tests/
/Mingla_Artifacts/
/Mingla_Roadmap/
